{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Malignity of Goblins",
    "steam_appid": 2907180,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907180/extras/4737f4c22d694ef0c722783e352e6fb7.avif?t=1746726619\" width=753 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907180/extras/3837de04e7d42ead453ff002331ba114.poster.avif?t=1746726619\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907180/extras/3837de04e7d42ead453ff002331ba114.webm?t=1746726619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine your unique skills to tackle daring quests and chaotic encounters, creating unforgettable moments and hilarious situations along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907180/extras/5e94e72a35247c0d395c7345a6247637.avif?t=1746726619\" width=668 height=106 /></span>The easiest way to kill your enemies is to hit them until they die but you never know what you'll face on your journey. Obviously you won\u2019t hit a millennial rock golem like you hit a cow. You need to adapt, prepare and coordinate with your teammate for each fight or improvise and hope for the best.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907180/extras/a44a1e2e3b0f8c787fa6146c832eb1d6.poster.avif?t=1746726619\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907180/extras/a44a1e2e3b0f8c787fa6146c832eb1d6.webm?t=1746726619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907180/extras/56839efa14a95138cf3d69b3808a6b9c.avif?t=1746726619\" width=360 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your weapons are not tailored for Goblins. Don\u2019t expect them to be easy to use! Your teammates can be at receiving end of a badly aimed arrow or spell. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907180/extras/22908fff25ae3190d43de4a4f657e20f.poster.avif?t=1746726619\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907180/extras/22908fff25ae3190d43de4a4f657e20f.webm?t=1746726619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907180/extras/6a91c5a2cfd5a5c8bacbeaea80a93d14.avif?t=1746726619\" width=432 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you are exploring the different biomes, you will be able to fish, hunt, trade with merchants, steal, make a snowman, drown, fall to your death and more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907180/extras/4e4a5736a99ef73f39f131823780750b.avif?t=1746726619\" width=298 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every act of chaos and every successful quest adds to your reputation, making you more respected and influential among the goblins and orcs alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907180/extras/a3da1a503ad37cea03b3fe308ed12c40.poster.avif?t=1746726619\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907180/extras/a3da1a503ad37cea03b3fe308ed12c40.webm?t=1746726619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907180/extras/b87ebfe7023251f1fb48f54014d280fe.avif?t=1746726619\" width=490 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each game explore and discover a new world! Use your sense of direction to find your way to your quest. You might get lost but don\u2019t worry that\u2019s where the fun begins!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907180/extras/4737f4c22d694ef0c722783e352e6fb7.avif?t=1746726619\" width=753 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907180/extras/3837de04e7d42ead453ff002331ba114.poster.avif?t=1746726619\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907180/extras/3837de04e7d42ead453ff002331ba114.webm?t=1746726619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine your unique skills to tackle daring quests and chaotic encounters, creating unforgettable moments and hilarious situations along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907180/extras/5e94e72a35247c0d395c7345a6247637.avif?t=1746726619\" width=668 height=106 /></span>The easiest way to kill your enemies is to hit them until they die but you never know what you'll face on your journey. Obviously you won\u2019t hit a millennial rock golem like you hit a cow. You need to adapt, prepare and coordinate with your teammate for each fight or improvise and hope for the best.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907180/extras/a44a1e2e3b0f8c787fa6146c832eb1d6.poster.avif?t=1746726619\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907180/extras/a44a1e2e3b0f8c787fa6146c832eb1d6.webm?t=1746726619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907180/extras/56839efa14a95138cf3d69b3808a6b9c.avif?t=1746726619\" width=360 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your weapons are not tailored for Goblins. Don\u2019t expect them to be easy to use! Your teammates can be at receiving end of a badly aimed arrow or spell. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907180/extras/22908fff25ae3190d43de4a4f657e20f.poster.avif?t=1746726619\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907180/extras/22908fff25ae3190d43de4a4f657e20f.webm?t=1746726619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907180/extras/6a91c5a2cfd5a5c8bacbeaea80a93d14.avif?t=1746726619\" width=432 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you are exploring the different biomes, you will be able to fish, hunt, trade with merchants, steal, make a snowman, drown, fall to your death and more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907180/extras/4e4a5736a99ef73f39f131823780750b.avif?t=1746726619\" width=298 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every act of chaos and every successful quest adds to your reputation, making you more respected and influential among the goblins and orcs alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907180/extras/a3da1a503ad37cea03b3fe308ed12c40.poster.avif?t=1746726619\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907180/extras/a3da1a503ad37cea03b3fe308ed12c40.webm?t=1746726619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907180/extras/b87ebfe7023251f1fb48f54014d280fe.avif?t=1746726619\" width=490 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each game explore and discover a new world! Use your sense of direction to find your way to your quest. You might get lost but don\u2019t worry that\u2019s where the fun begins!</p>",
